    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "47tolye",
      "content": "<strong>How to Use This Book</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "64ah2ht",
      "content": "This guide book is designed specifically for aspirants of PSU Navratna recruitment examinations. It covers all four common sections tested in PSU CBT examinations: Quantitative Aptitude, Logical Reasoning, English Language and General Awareness. Each unit contains concept notes, worked examples, formula tables, and practice MCQs with answers. Solve all practice questions before attempting mock tests. Focus on accuracy before speed."
    },
    {
      "id": "e8mm56w",
      "type": "image",
      "imageId": "e8znmm6",
      "src": "/books/Guide/BASE BOOK/images/image_e8znmm6.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "wiwu3dz",
      "type": "image",
      "imageId": "f07hx58",
      "src": "/books/Guide/BASE BOOK/images/image_f07hx58.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "t1rlhc8",
      "type": "image",
      "imageId": "xnde6o8",
